# Story page: blank
# {name} becomes the snake's name. Paragraphs are separated by a blank line.
title = The Blank Page
---
In the empty workshop where worlds are drawn, one page glowed brighter than all the rest.

It was blank: perfectly, terrifyingly blank, a world that has not been written yet, which is the most frightening kind there is.

'Every coil needs someone to draw the next circle,' whispered the page. 'Your turn.' For once in my long and unfortunate life, I had nothing to add.
